{%- comment -%} build: mx-plate-landing-v7 {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Custom Motocross Number Plate Hats (threadbreak.com/pages/custom-motocross-number-plate-hats)
  Template suffix: mx-plate-order  (templates/page.mx-plate-order.liquid)

  - 24 plate designs are inline vector art from NumberPlates.ai (artboard n = data-plate n), with a
    "NAME" placeholder (class .nm) that is hidden when the customer chooses "No name".
  - HATS_DATA (in the script) is a copy of the STYLES colors/photos from page.custom-order.liquid for the
    Otto, Richardson, Yupoong and Flexfit styles. Atonal, 10 10 Hats and the fitted Flexfit styles with sizes
    (6277, 6511) are left out. Re-sync it if the custom order form's colors change.
  - Add to cart posts to /cart/add.js using the Shopify product "Custom Motocross Number Plate Hat"
    (product 15444537606276, type Custom Hats + tag custom-order-form so cart quantity stays locked).
    One variant per hat group (Otto / Richardson, Yupoong, Flexfit) x quantity bracket (1, 2-4, 5-9, 10+).
    Design details go in line item properties. VARIANTS and TIERS in the script must match those prices.
{%- endcomment -%}
