<button type="button" data-m="name" aria-pressed="true">Add a name</button>
<button type="button" data-m="none" aria-pressed="false">No name</button>
</div>
<div id="nameWrap" style="margin-top:10px">
<input type="text" id="nameInput" maxlength="14" autocapitalize="characters" autocomplete="off" placeholder="SMITH">
</div>
<p class="hint">The designs show "NAME" where your name goes. Choose No name for the version without it.</p>
</div>
<div class="field-block">
<div class="field-label"><span class="n">4</span> Leatherette color</div>
<div class="swatch-row" id="colorRow"></div>
<p class="hint">The plates above update to show your color.</p>
</div>
<div class="field-block">
<div class="field-label"><span class="n">5</span> How many hats</div>
<div class="stepper">
<button type="button" class="step-btn" id="qtyMinus" aria-label="Fewer hats">&minus;</button>
<input type="number" id="qtyNum" class="mx-qty-input" min="1" max="100" value="1" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Number of hats">
<button type="button" class="step-btn" id="qtyPlus" aria-label="More hats">+</button>
</div>
<div class="quick-qty" id="quickQty">
<button type="button" data-q="1" aria-pressed="true">1 hat</button>
<button type="button" data-q="5" aria-pressed="false">5 &middot; Family Deal</button>
<button type="button" data-q="10" aria-pressed="false">10 &middot; Friends + Family</button>
</div>
<p class="hint">Every hat in your order gets the same plate, number and name. Hat colors can be different.</p>
<div class="price-box" id="priceBox"></div>
<table class="ladder" id="ladder"></table>
</div>
<div class="field-block">
<div class="field-label"><span class="n">6</span> Hat and color</div>
<p class="hint" id="hatHint">Tap a hat, then choose its colors.</p>
<div class="mx-seg4" id="hatBrands"></div>
<div class="mx-hatscroll" id="hatScroll"></div>
<div id="hatDetail"></div>
</div>
<div class="field-block">
<div class="field-label"><span class="n">7</span> Patch placement</div>
<div class="mx-place" id="placeRow">
<button type="button" data-p="Left" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 90 56" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 40C10 14 26 6 45 6S80 14 80 40Z" fill="#3a3d44"/><path d="M3 40Q45 58 87 40Q45 46 3 40Z" fill="#202228"/><rect x="23" y="17" width="18" height="14" rx="3" fill="#a07be8"/></svg><span>Left side</span></button>
<button type="button" data-p="Center" aria-pressed="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 90 56" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 40C10 14 26 6 45 6S80 14 80 40Z" fill="#3a3d44"/><path d="M3 40Q45 58 87 40Q45 46 3 40Z" fill="#202228"/><rect x="36" y="17" width="18" height="14" rx="3" fill="#a07be8"/></svg><span>Centered</span></button>
<button type="button" data-p="Right" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 90 56" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 40C10 14 26 6 45 6S80 14 80 40Z" fill="#3a3d44"/><path d="M3 40Q45 58 87 40Q45 46 3 40Z" fill="#202228"/><rect x="49" y="17" width="18" height="14" rx="3" fill="#a07be8"/></svg><span>Right side</span></button>
</div>
<p class="hint">Front panel only. Left and right are as you look at the front of the hat.</p>
</div>
<div class="summary" id="summary">Pick a brand and design to get started.</div>
<button class="cta cta-block" id="addBtn" disabled>Add to cart</button>
<p class="cart-msg" id="cartMsg"></p>
<p class="proof-note">We produce your patch exactly as entered, so double-check the number and spelling before ordering. Made to order in 1 to 2 weeks. Need it sooner? Email help@threadbreak.com before you order.</p>
</div>
</div>
